1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,570
The reusable output is an Optimization Passport and evidence bundle.

2
00:00:03,570 --> 00:00:11,000
It binds hardware, runtime, model, workload, quality policy, candidate plan, drift checks, cleanup proof, and every selection decision.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,720
A deployment bundle is produced only when an eligible profile exists.

4
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:19,340
Missing or incomplete evidence stays missing instead of becoming a convenient performance story.

